  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "From the third equation of angular motion,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;&#952;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></math><br /><br />or <math><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />or <math><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />or <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> ...(i)<br /><br />According to question again applying the third equation of angular motion<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> <math><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math><br /><br />But <math><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> cycle<br /><br />So, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math>"
